+// DFI Network's stealable rares and dungeon decoration, ported from DFI RunUO
+// Scripts/Custom/Engines/StealableRareSystem. Each rare is a fixed item a DFI spawner puts back a day
+// after it is taken: town rares need 80 stealing (fully reliable at 100), Doom rares 100 (150). DFI never
+// connected the rares to the Stealing skill; GUO does, through DfiRares.Steal, at the owner's request.
+
+using ModernUO.Serialization;
